  // ---- supaslides-derived looks (Aurora and its siblings) ----
  //
  // These looks do not emphasise with a pop colour. They derive a tonal ladder
  // from the surface — text mixed back toward the background by a percentage —
  // and emphasise by making a phrase *brighter* than its surroundings.
  /** Base headline colour: text mixed 64% over bg. */
